<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 427 0 R
/E (Electrical fires are mainly caused by overheated wiring, voltage surges, and current overloads. Traditional fire alarms detect smoke or heat only after a fire starts. An AI-based real-time system can predict fire risks before ignition and help prevent accidents.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
