<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 436 0 R
/E (In conclusion, we developed an AI-powered electrical fire prevention system using ESP32, IoT, and Machine Learning. The system continuously monitors electrical parameters to predict potential hazards at an early stage. During critical conditions, it automatically disconnects the power supply, activates an alarm, and sends SMS notifications. Overall, this system provides a smart, reliable, cost-effective, and scalable solution to improve electrical safety in various environments.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
